WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.311
Week 10: Likes, Preferences, and Leisure. express likes and dislikes invite and suggest compare activities

2
00:00:07.311 --> 00:00:29.223
Read for the situation. A Camila le encanta el cine, pero a Diego le interesan más los deportes. Buscan una actividad que puedan disfrutar juntos y eligen un festival al aire libre. Camila loves movies, but Diego is more interested in sports. They look for an activity they can enjoy together and choose an outdoor festival.

3
00:00:29.223 --> 00:00:37.985
Read again for evidence. Identify who acts, what changes, when it happens, and which words establish the relationship between events.

4
00:00:37.985 --> 00:00:43.995
Reading activities. Reading activity 23; Reading activity 24

5
00:00:43.995 --> 00:00:51.989
Retell. Without looking back, give the main idea, three supporting details, and one reasonable inference in Spanish.

6
00:00:51.989 --> 00:01:19.868
Model language. Me gusta escuchar música en vivo. — I like listening to live music. A Tomás le interesan los documentales. — Tomás is interested in documentaries. ¿Prefieres salir o quedarte en casa? — Do you prefer going out or staying home? Nos encanta jugar juntos. — We love playing together. El senderismo es más tranquilo que el fútbol. — Hiking is calmer than soccer.

7
00:01:19.868 --> 00:01:30.022
Check your readiness. Explain the core idea. Produce an original example. Complete the section assessment at 85% or higher.
